title: 주5_금_2교시_도서관_신아산_영문
---
<<show san_idle>>
(Exams are right around the corner, so I’d better head to the library to study.)
(If I can just survive this week, it's finally the end of the semester....)
{name()}: Oh? ASan?
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_shock>>
ASan: Huh?
ASan: Since when did you actually know how to study?
(Has it ever crossed your mind that I might be a total study bug too?!?!?!!?)
<<play 신아산_흠>>
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: Just so you know, I don't have any past exam papers to give you.
{name()}: Wasn't expecting any.
<<show san_shock>>
ASan: Seriously?
ASan: I do have the lecture summaries, though.
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Well...
ASan: I might give them to you if we study together.
<<choice 주5_금_2교시_도서관_신아산_긍정1_영문 "Of course." 주5_금_2교시_도서관_신아산_부정1_영문 "I've got my own lecture summaries, so I don't need to." true>>
ASan: Want to join me?
===

title: 주5_금_2교시_도서관_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Of course.
{name()}: I desperately need your help if I want to avoid taking Applied Blockchain for the third time.
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Good.
ASan: I reserved a group study room, so let's head over there.
{name()}: Sure, sounds good.
{name()}: Since you're helping me out, I'll buy you dinner later.
<<show san_blush>>
ASan: Whoa.
ASan: I wasn't really planning on helping, but I guess I have to now if I'm getting a free meal.
ASan: Well, alright.
ASan: It's not like you actually know anything anyway.
{name()}: Yes, ma'am... I'm in your hands.
<<show san_smile>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: I'm counting on you too!
(And so, ASan and I stayed cooped up in the study room all day.)
(Thanks to her, I think I might actually avoid taking this class a third time.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_2교시_도서관_신아산_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: I've got my own lecture summaries, so I don't really need them.
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: ..... Oh, really?
ASan: Do you even know the specific topics the professor highlighted?
ASan: You were knocked out asleep during that part last time.
ASan: ........
ASan: I could tell you what they are.
{name()}: You mean the ones from the very last lecture?
{name()}: I already have those, so I'm good.
<<play 신아산_허>>
<<show san_neg2>>
ASan: Is that so?
ASan: Well, good luck studying, then.
ASan: I've got a group study room reserved for myself.
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
(As ASan said that, she had a strangely disappointed look on her face.)
(Maybe I should have just studied with her...)
<<end>>
===